---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import BreadcrumbSchema from "../components/schema/BreadcrumbSchema.astro";
const breadcrumbs = [
    { name: "Home", url: "https://enclavetools.com" },
    { name: "Privacy Policy" },
];
---

<Layout
    site="Enclavetools"
    title="Privacy Policy"
    tagline="How we handle your data and respect your privacy"
    eyebrow="Last Updated: June 4, 2026"
    pageTitle="Privacy Policy"
    pageDescription="Privacy Policy for Enclavetools - AI tools directory."
    showHero={true}
>
    <BreadcrumbSchema items={breadcrumbs} />

    <div class="max-w-[800px] mx-auto px-4 md:px-8 py-16">
        <div
            class="bg-white border border-brand-forest/10 p-6 md:p-8 shadow-sm"
        >
            <article class="prose prose-gray max-w-none text-brand-forest/80">
                <p class="text-base leading-relaxed mb-4 font-medium">
                    At Enclavetools, accessible from https://enclavetools.com,
                    one of our main priorities is the privacy of our visitors.
                    This Privacy Policy document contains types of information
                    that is collected and recorded by Enclavetools and how we
                    use it.
                </p>

                <h2
                    class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-brand-forest mt-8 mb-4 tracking-tight uppercase"
                >
                    1. Data Collection
                </h2>
                <p class="text-base leading-relaxed mb-4 font-medium">
                    Enclavetools is a static website designed to provide
                    information about AI tools. We do not require user
                    registration and do not collect any personally identifiable
                    information (PII) directly from you unless you choose to
                    contact us through external channels (e.g., GitHub or Social
                    Media).
                </p>

                <h2
                    class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-brand-forest mt-8 mb-4 tracking-tight uppercase"
                >
                    2. Local Storage (Bookmarks)
                </h2>
                <p class="text-base leading-relaxed mb-4 font-medium">
                    Our "Saved Tools" feature uses your browser's <strong
                        class="text-brand-forest font-extrabold"
                        >localStorage</strong
                    > to store the IDs of tools you have bookmarked. This data is
                    stored locally on your device and is never sent to our servers.
                    You can clear this data at any time by clearing your browser's
                    cache or using the "Remove" option in the UI.
                </p>

                <h2
                    class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-brand-forest mt-8 mb-4 tracking-tight uppercase"
                >
                    3. Analytics
                </h2>
                <p class="text-base leading-relaxed mb-4 font-medium">
                    We use Google Analytics to understand how visitors interact
                    with our website. Google Analytics uses cookies to track
                    anonymized data (e.g., pages visited, session duration).
                    This helps us improve the user experience.
                </p>
                <p class="text-base leading-relaxed mb-4 font-medium">
                    <strong class="text-brand-forest font-extrabold">We do not load Google Analytics until you give explicit consent.</strong>
                    Our implementation uses Google Consent Mode v2 — no analytics cookies are set and no data is sent to Google until you
                    actively opt in through our cookie consent banner.
                </p>

                <h2
                    class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-brand-forest mt-8 mb-4 tracking-tight uppercase"
                >
                    4. Cookies
                </h2>
                <p class="text-base leading-relaxed mb-4 font-medium">
                    We use two categories of cookies on our website:
                </p>
                <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-base font-medium text-brand-forest/80 mb-4">
                    <li><strong class="text-brand-forest">Strictly Necessary</strong> — Required for the website to function. These cannot be disabled.</li>
                    <li><strong class="text-brand-forest">Analytics</strong> — Used by Google Analytics to collect anonymous usage data. Only active if you explicitly consent.</li>
                </ul>
                <p class="text-base leading-relaxed mb-4 font-medium">
                    You can change your cookie preferences at any time by clicking <strong class="text-brand-forest">"Cookie Settings"</strong>
                    in the footer of any page. If you have previously consented and wish to withdraw, doing so will immediately stop all analytics tracking.
                </p>
                <p class="text-base leading-relaxed mb-4 font-medium">
                    We also honor the <strong class="text-brand-forest">Global Privacy Control (GPC)</strong> signal.
                    If your browser sends a GPC opt-out signal, analytics cookies will be automatically disabled regardless of your consent banner selection,
                    in compliance with CCPA/CPRA requirements.
                </p>

                <h2
                    class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-brand-forest mt-8 mb-4 tracking-tight uppercase"
                >
                    5. Third-Party Links
                </h2>
                <p class="text-base leading-relaxed mb-4 font-medium">
                    Our directory provides links to many external AI tools. We
                    do not control and are not responsible for the privacy
                    practices or content of these third-party sites. We
                    encourage you to review their policies separately.
                </p>

                <h2
                    class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-brand-forest mt-8 mb-4 tracking-tight uppercase"
                >
                    6. Consent
                </h2>
                <p class="text-base leading-relaxed mb-4 font-medium">
                    By using our website, you agree to our Privacy Policy.
                    However, <strong class="text-brand-forest">non-essential cookies (analytics) are only activated if you explicitly opt in</strong>
                    through our cookie consent banner. Continuing to browse without making a choice does not constitute consent.
                    You have the right to withdraw your consent at any time via the "Cookie Settings" link in our footer.
                </p>
                <p class="text-base leading-relaxed mb-4 font-medium">
                    Our consent mechanism is designed to comply with major worldwide regulations including the GDPR (EU), ePrivacy Directive (EU),
                    UK GDPR, CCPA/CPRA (California), LGPD (Brazil), and PIPEDA (Canada).
                </p>

                <h2
                    class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-brand-forest mt-8 mb-4 tracking-tight uppercase"
                >
                    7. Contact
                </h2>
                <p class="text-base leading-relaxed mb-4 font-medium">
                    If you have questions about our privacy practices, feel free
                    to reach out to <a href="https://t.me/Mamylinx" class="text-brand-teal hover:text-brand-forest transition-colors" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Telegram</a> or via email at
                    mamy.else@gmail.com
                </p>
            </article>
        </div>
    </div>
</Layout>
